<title>UK: Taiwan to tender to buy 18,000 t white sugar - trade.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to tender to buy 18,000 t white sugar - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan is to hold a tender to buy 18,000 tonnes of white sugar on June 6, trade sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The shipment period was July 17 to 31, they added. No more details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
